OL,3,GNEWSABass guitar used for Bond theme
OL,4,Atune up for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe original bass guitar used to record
OL,7,Fthe iconic James Bond theme tune could
OL,8,Ffetch up to #10,000 at auction.
OL,10,FMike Peters, a bassist with The John
OL,11,FBarry Seven pop group, used his 1962
OL,12,FFender Precision bass guitar to record
OL,13,Fthe score and distinctive theme tune
OL,14,Ffor the first James Bond film, Dr No,
OL,15,Fin 1963.
OL,17,FAuctioneer Luke Hobbs, said: "I doubt
OL,18,Fany of the musicians involved back in
OL,19,F1962 could have realised how iconic
OL,20,Fthis one minute and 49 seconds of music
OL,21,Fwould become."
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
